e red HDMI de 60 m, aleaci\u00f3n de aluminio gris, est\u00e1ndar de la UE<\/h2><p><b>Extensi\u00f3n extra de 50M<\/b><\/p><p>Rompe el l\u00edmite de longitud del cable HDMI original y reduce el coste de renovaci\u00f3n.<\/p><p><ul><li>Transmisor (TX) &#8596; Receptor (RX)<\/li><li>50 m &#8212; Alta fidelidad<\/li><\/ul><\/p><h2>Especificaciones<\/h2><p><ul><li><b>Resoluci\u00f3n:<\/b> 1080P\/60Hz<\/li><li><b>Est\u00e1ndar del cable de red:<\/b> Superior a Cat.5e<\/li><li><b>Longitud del cable de red:<\/b> &#8804; 50 m<\/li><li><b>Longitud HDMI:&nbsp;<\/b><span style='background-color: initial;'>Lado de entrada (transmisor):<\/span><span style='background-color: initial;'> &#8804; 20 m,&nbsp;<\/span><span style='background-color: initial;'>Lado de salida (receptor):<\/span><span style='background-color: initial;'> &#8804; 20 m<\/span><\/li><li><b>La longitud del cable HDMI y el AWG relacionado deben ajustarse seg\u00fan la tabla siguiente:<\/b><\/li><li>0.75&#8211;3m | 5&#8211;10m | 12&#8211;15m | 20m<\/li><li>30AWG | 28AWG | 26AWG | 24AWG<\/li><li><b>Aviso:<\/b> Este producto no incluye cable de red ni cable HDMI; compre cables premium para una transmisi\u00f3n estable.<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"VENTION","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":27.75,"unit_price_tax":27.75,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Adaptadores","sub_category":"Adaptadores de V\u00eddeo Inal\u00e1mbricos","quantity":0,"brand":"VENTION","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_ven-transm%20akgh0-eu_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":20.75}}},"6925281993060":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["692528199