 5.3<\/li>\t<li><b>LAN:<\/b> 10\/100\/1000\/2500 Mbps, 2.5 G LAN<\/li>\t<li><b>Audio:<\/b> Conexant CX20632<\/li>\t<li><b>Fuente de alimentaci\u00f3n:<\/b> 19 V DC, 6.3 A, 119.7 W<\/li>\t<li><b>Temperatura de funcionamiento:<\/b> 0&#8211;40 \u00b0C<\/li>\t<li><b>Panel frontal - Puertos:<\/b> 1x Jack 3.5 mm TRRS Combo, 1x USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C, 1x USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-A<\/li>\t<li><b>Panel frontal - Botones:<\/b> Power, Reset<\/li>\t<li><b>Panel I\/O - Puertos USB:<\/b> 1x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type-A, 1x USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-A, 2x USB 2.0 Type-A<\/li>\t<li><b>Panel I\/O - Salidas de v\u00eddeo:<\/b> 1x HDMI 2.0, 1x DisplayPort 1.2<\/li>\t<li><b>Panel I\/O - Red:<\/b> 1x RJ45 2.5 G LAN<\/li>\t<li><b>Panel I\/O - Entrada de energ\u00eda:<\/b> DC-in 19 V<\/li>\t<li><b>Panel I\/O - Sonido:<\/b> 2x Jack 3.5 mm TRS<\/li>\t<li><b>Dimensiones (con soporte):<\/b> 617 \u00d7 451 \u00d7 200 mm<\/li>\t<li><b>Dimensiones (sin soporte):<\/b> 617 \u00d7 358 \u00d7 33 mm<\/li>\t<li><b>Peso:<\/b> Con soporte: 3,50 kg; sin: 3,13 kg; embalado: 6,04 kg<\/li>\t<li><b>Sostenibilidad:<\/b> RoHS, embalaje 100 % reciclable, libre de mercurio<\/li>\t<li><b>Certificaciones:<\/b> CB, CE, T\u00dcV\/ISO9241-307, T\u00dcV-BAUART, EAC, EAEU, RoHS, KC, CEL, CCC, CECP, UKCA, EMF, FCC, ICES-003<\/li><\/ul>                                            ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"ARCTIC","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":4.2,"unit_price":463.53,"unit_price_tax":463.53,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Ordenadores","sub_category":"Ordenadores Sobremesa","quantity":2,"brand":"ARCTIC","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_arct-d%20acpcc00003a_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":456.53}}},"4895213705134":{"re